# Learnings Reference

When making **architectural** or **convention** decisions in Eventiva, read the relevant files in `docs/learnings/` so decisions align with the rebuild plan and stored learnings.

## Location

- **Eventiva/docs/learnings/** – Index: `README.md`. Themed files: architecture, conventions, tdd-and-test-creation, modular-include-exclude, docs-and-apis, ci-and-devcontainer, effect-migration-notes, evolution-chain-learnings, odoo-extensions-reference.

## When to use

- Choosing backend composition, Layer/Service boundaries, or cluster design → `architecture.md`, `effect-migration-notes.md`.
- File headers, naming, licensing → `conventions.md`.
- Test strategy, schema-first, who writes tests → `tdd-and-test-creation.md` and `.cursor/rules/tdd-test-creation.mdc`.
- Module inclusion, extensions, manifest → `modular-include-exclude.md`, `odoo-extensions-reference.md`.
- Docs format, README.adoc → README.md script → `docs-and-apis.md`.
- CI, DevContainer, Bit removal → `ci-and-devcontainer.md`.
- Effect vs Zod/Drizzle, migration path → `effect-migration-notes.md`, `evolution-chain-learnings.md`.
